This product is a Cangjie (仓颉) port of the EU Digital Identity Wallet
ISO/IEC 18013-5 mDoc data model library for Swift:

    eudi-lib-ios-iso18013-data-model
    Copyright (c) European Commission
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    https://github.com/eu-digital-identity-wallet/eudi-lib-ios-iso18013-data-model

The data model (DeviceEngagement, MSO/IssuerAuth, DeviceRequest/Response,
known doc types, SecureArea protocol, ZKP specs) is reimplemented in Cangjie
with the original Swift sources used as the reference implementation.

This product depends on and/or bundles the following third-party software:

  - eudi_lib_cbor (Apache License 2.0 expected; pinned third_party clone) —
    CBOR encoding/decoding backbone.
  - eudi_lib_core_crypto (pinned third_party clone) — digest primitives.
  - cangjie-stdx 1.1.3.1 (Apache License 2.0) — bundled under entry/libs/stdx/.
  - OpenSSL runtime libraries and libsecurec.so, bundled under
    entry/libs/arm64-v8a/ for on-device execution.

